<title>UK: Spintab ups domestic bond to 1.2 bln Danish crowns.</title>
<headline>Spintab ups domestic bond to 1.2 bln Danish crowns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spintab has increased to 1.2 billion Danish crowns from 700 million crowns the size of its 4.00 percent five-year domestic bond, lead manager BG Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue price was undisclosed. The November 2001 deal will be listed in Copenhagen.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
